        "fields": {
          "notes": "Provisional identity for the Old Babylonian Akkadian Gilgamesh transmission cluster, whose surviving witnesses present a varied and incomplete textual tradition. The five Sumerian Gilgamesh compositions and the Standard Babylonian poem have separate work identities; tablets, eBL editorial units, and modern scholarly representations carry their own source histories."
